<title>ITALY: Italian dockers suspend 48-hour port strike.</title>
<headline>Italian dockers suspend 48-hour port strike.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian dockers have suspended a strike planned for today and Friday after the Transport Ministry called a meeting with unions for Thursday, a union statement said.</p>
<p>The FILT-CGIL, FIT-CISL and UILTrasporti unions said in a joint statement they had decided to suspend the 48-hour industrial action after hearing the meeting had been called.</p>
</text>
